Dialogue: 2,0:43:57.31,0:43:59.53,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}Your dream for the future
Dialogue: 2,0:44:00.30,0:44:02.47,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}seems unattainable
Dialogue: 2,0:44:03.85,0:44:08.60,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}even through all your toil
Dialogue: 2,0:44:09.27,0:44:12.25,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 2,0:44:12.25,0:44:14.98,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}you cannot give up
Dialogue: 2,0:44:15.76,0:44:21.38,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}on hoping for brighter days
Dialogue: 2,0:44:24.84,0:44:30.27,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur6}In your hand you hold
Dialogue: 2,0:44:30.78,0:44:35.53,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}the fragments of our lives
Dialogue: 2,0:44:36.80,0:44:42.04,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur6}Stay your heart of doubt
Dialogue: 2,0:44:42.79,0:44:50.04,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur6}and soar through the night
Dialogue: 2,0:44:51.42,0:44:57.46,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}Relying on others
Dialogue: 2,0:44:57.46,0:45:03.45,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}will not help you find your true self
Dialogue: 2,0:45:03.45,0:45:09.30,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur6}Dispel this illusion
Dialogue: 2,0:45:09.30,0:45:18.07,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,350)\blur6}and open your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.19,0:45:41.58,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}The wind spreads
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.23,0:45:44.41,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}long-forgotten smiles
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.79,0:45:50.30,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}like dusty old paper
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.08,0:45:53.89,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Praying for the power
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.27,0:45:56.73,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}to accomplish more tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.75,0:46:03.45,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}is only making it harder for you
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.79,0:46:12.55,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Your body has grown hard as ice
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.68,0:46:17.03,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}even as your dream is budding
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.78,0:46:24.52,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Fly towards the dawn
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.79,0:46:32.62,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}before you turn to ash
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.47,0:46:39.03,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Relying on others
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.45,0:46:45.43,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}will not help you find your true self
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.43,0:46:51.51,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Dispel this illusion
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.51,0:46:56.81,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}and open your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.39,0:47:03.15,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Isn't it enough to live for the moment
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.42,0:47:09.50,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}and dedicate it to others
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.50,0:47:15.48,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur6}Abandon your pretense
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.48,0:47:25.16,Ending2-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,450)\blur6}and be yourself{let it go~}
Dialogue: 3,0:43:57.31,0:43:59.53,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Your dream for the future
Dialogue: 3,0:44:00.30,0:44:02.47,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}seems unattainable
Dialogue: 3,0:44:03.85,0:44:08.60,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}even through all your toil
Dialogue: 3,0:44:09.27,0:44:12.25,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}No matter what you do,
Dialogue: 3,0:44:12.25,0:44:14.98,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}you cannot give up
Dialogue: 3,0:44:15.76,0:44:21.38,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}on hoping for brighter days
Dialogue: 3,0:44:24.84,0:44:30.27,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur0.75}In your hand you hold
Dialogue: 3,0:44:30.78,0:44:35.53,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}the fragments of our lives
Dialogue: 3,0:44:36.80,0:44:42.04,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur0.75}Stay your heart of doubt
Dialogue: 3,0:44:42.79,0:44:50.04,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,100)\blur0.75}and soar through the night
Dialogue: 3,0:44:51.42,0:44:57.46,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Relying on others
Dialogue: 3,0:44:57.46,0:45:03.45,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}will not help you find your true self
Dialogue: 3,0:45:03.45,0:45:09.30,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Dispel this illusion
Dialogue: 3,0:45:09.30,0:45:18.07,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,113,,{\an9\fad(150,350)\blur0.75}and open your eyes
Dialogue: 1,0:45:39.35,0:45:41.30,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}The wind spreads
Dialogue: 1,0:45:42.36,0:45:44.04,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}long-forgotten smiles
Dialogue: 1,0:45:45.91,0:45:50.30,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}like dusty old paper
Dialogue: 1,0:45:51.36,0:45:53.89,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Praying for the power
Dialogue: 1,0:45:54.36,0:45:56.43,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}to accomplish more tomorrow
Dialogue: 1,0:45:57.91,0:46:03.36,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}is only making it harder for you
Dialogue: 1,0:46:06.92,0:46:12.34,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Your body has grown hard as ice
Dialogue: 1,0:46:12.85,0:46:16.85,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}even as your dream is budding
Dialogue: 1,0:46:18.92,0:46:24.15,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}Fly towards the dawn
Dialogue: 1,0:46:24.91,0:46:32.39,Ending2-English-L1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,250)\blur0.75}before you turn to ash
