Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.19,0:01:59.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Diante do desespero absoluto
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.53,0:02:03.23,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Que quase consumiu os nossos corações
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.73,0:02:09.78,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Você ainda encontrou a coragem para sorrir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.03,0:02:14.58,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Como se aceitasse tudo aquilo
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.38,0:02:17.84,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu perdi a minha voz
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:20.46,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}E as palavras que queria dizer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.74,0:02:25.71,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Mas a cada vez que caía de joelhos
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.06,0:02:30.01,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Eu me levantava e continuava a caminhar
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.28,0:02:35.68,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Estávamos buscando o futuro branco ideal
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.89,0:02:40.91,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}A nossa única esperança
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.24,0:02:43.40,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Agora posso ter ficado sem nada
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.57,0:02:48.82,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}A não ser estas emoções ardentes que
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.88,0:02:51.92,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Não têm para onde ir
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.17,0:02:57.17,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Ainda assim, buscarei um novo amanhecer
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.55,0:03:00.58,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,380)\blur7.5}Com mais de uma resposta certa
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.82,0:03:04.41,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,0)\blur7.5}Não vou parar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.71,0:03:06.44,Opening1-English-L0,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,380)\blur7.5}Até encontrar
